In here you will find scripts to download the latest environmental data, such as OMNI solar wind data or F10.7. 
You will also find scripts to plot the basic data products. 

To update the data: 
./updata_data.sh 

This will repopulate the data/ directory with F10.7 and OMNI data. If the connection fails, just do it again. 

To update the config file, edit the paths in make_config.py. The python code uses the config file to find the data. Then run it: 
python make_config.py 

To run the plotting code, type: 
python plot_data.py 

The summary plot will be put into the reports/ directory. 
